{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06347","headline":"寄焦链师 · 李颀","name":"寄焦链师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得道凡百岁，烧丹惟一身。\n悠悠孤峰顶，日见三花春。\n白鹤翠微里，黄精幽涧滨。\n始知世上客，不及山中人。\n仙境若在梦，朝云如可亲。\n何由覩颜色，挥手谢风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}